      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think a \"moment\" of peace is enough anymore. it's like trying to put a bandaid on a gaping wound. what i really mean is i want the noise to stop for good. i want to not have to be \"on\" or responsible or exhausted ever again. i just want to finally be free of it all. part of me thinks that's the only way to actually find that quiet i'm looking for.",
